OL,3,APublicly owned rail is popular. But is
OL,4,Ait making the trains run on time?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublicly owned rail is popular. But is
OL,7,Fit making the trains run on time?
OL,9,FThe early afternoon of Wednesday 6
OL,10,FAugust was an unremarkable one on the
OL,11,Frail network. Then suddenly, shortly
OL,12,Fbefore 14:00, a power failure brought
OL,13,Ftrains across the north-west of England
OL,14,Fto a halt.
OL,16,FChaos ensued: passengers told the BBC
OL,17,Fthey were stranded on platforms for
OL,18,Fhours, with some having to book hotels
OL,19,Ffor the night.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,111,105,200,300,0,100
