OL,3,APublicly owned rail is popular. But is
OL,4,Ait making the trains run on time?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis incident, stemming from a short
OL,7,Fpower cut that affected Network Rail's
OL,8,Foperating centre in Manchester, was, in
OL,9,Fitself, unusual. But it added to a
OL,10,Fdifficult summer for train passengers.
